# Vercel source-upload guard (P1 weight diet). Git deployments upload tracked
# files; this file keeps runtime-irrelevant weight out of every deployment.
# NEVER exclude /scripts/: client/vite.config.js requires
# ../scripts/production-guard.js at build time (a past revision broke
# previews this way). Runtime code (server/src, client/src, client/public,
# api/, server/data) is untouched by every pattern below.
/client/android/
/docs/
/supabase/.temp/
/server/.cache-jmdict/
/client/scripts/
/server/tests/
/client/tests/
brag-output-*/
backups/
coverage/
*.docx
*.log
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks
local.properties
